{"id":"NCT05071144","title":"Advanced SPinal Innovations With Robotics and Enabling Technology Registry","official":"Advanced SPinal Innovations With Robotics and Enabling Technology Registry","summary":"Creation of a pediatric robotic spine surgery registry will allow for data collection and analysis on the coupled use of robotics and navigation, as well as patient-specific rods in pediatric spine deformity surgery across participating study institutions. Eventually, an educational and informative framework for this technology will be established.","conditions":["Spine Deformity","Idiopathic Scoliosis","Adolescent Idiopathic Scoliosis","Spondylolisthesis","Congenital Scoliosis","Neuromuscular Scoliosis"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Diagnosis of a spine deformity\n* Scheduled for surgery using robotics and navigation and/or patient-specific rods\n* Up to and including 21 years of age\n* Speak and read English or Spanish\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n• None","minAge":"0 Years","maxAge":"21 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":true,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":700,"start":"2021-12-13","pcd":"2030-12","upd":"2026-06-22","sponsor":"Boston Children's Hospital","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Jessie Tonole, BA · 857-218-3272 · Jessica.Tonole@childrens.harvard.edu","Sara Olenich, MS, CSCS · Sara.Olenich@childrens.harvard.edu"],"sites":[{"f":"Cedars-Sinai Medical Center","city":"Los Angeles","pr":"California","zip":"90048","s":"NYR","lat":34.0522,"lon":-118.2437,"c":"David Skaggs, MD · David.Skaggs@cshs.org"},{"f":"Children's Hospital Colorado","city":"Aurora","pr":"Colorado","zip":"80045","s":"R","lat":39.7294,"lon":-104.8319,"c":"Mark Erickson, MD · Mark.Erickson@childrenscolorado.org"},{"f":"Children's Healthcare of Atlanta","city":"Atlanta","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30342","s":"R","lat":33.749,"lon":-84.388,"c":"Dennis Devito, MD · Dennis.Devito@choa.org"},{"f":"Boston Children's Hospital","city":"Boston","pr":"Massachusetts","zip"